# 7. How this plugs into videos

This is the killer use-case.

When the essay/storyboard generator creates a frame, instead of generic search it can query the glossary.

Example:

```txt
Frame:
This section discusses conjunction and the union of opposites.

System:
Search concepts = conjunction, sun_moon_union, rebis
Return top 5 artwork matches
Prefer assets marked good_for_quote_overlay and good_for_animation
```

Then the storyboard frame becomes:

```txt
Use approved conjunction plate #3
Animate with slow zoom and subtle gold shimmer
Overlay quote during 00:42–00:49
```

That gives you huge consistency across essays.

