# 9. Best workflow to build it

Do it semi-manually at first.

## Phase 1: Curate

Collect 100–300 strong alchemical/hermetic images.

For each:

* title
* source
* license
* short description
* concept tags
* style tags

## Phase 2: Define concepts

Build maybe 50 core concepts first:

```txt
prima materia
nigredo
albedo
rubedo
conjunction
separatio
solve et coagula
mercurius
philosopher's stone
vessel
ouroboros
sun
moon
salt
sulfur
mercury
rebis
world soul
macrocosm
microcosm
```

## Phase 3: Link art to concepts

Each artwork gets linked to 1–5 concepts.

## Phase 4: Add animation variants

Only for the best ones first.

## Phase 5: Plug into storyboard engine

When a concept appears, use glossary-first retrieval.

