# 10. How AI helps here

AI can assist with:

## Artwork description

Generate a clean description of the image.

## Tag suggestion

Suggest concept/style tags.

## Concept linkage

Infer likely related concepts.

## Essay matching

When a frame says “union of opposites,” map it to conjunction/rebis.

## Animation prompt generation

Suggest how a still image could be animated subtly.

But I would not let AI fully auto-tag everything at first.
You want a curated symbolic corpus, not noisy junk.

So best model is:

```txt
AI suggests
human approves
system stores
```

