# 11. Very important distinction

You are not making a generic stock-image library.

You are making a **symbolically indexed visual corpus**.

That means the retrieval logic is not:

```txt
keyword match only
```

It is:

```txt
conceptual similarity
symbolic relation
visual style coherence
historical relevance
video suitability
```

That is much more interesting.

